        'rawContent': '{{Starship Class Information|\n|name = Belarus Class Tanker\n|image = BelarusClassTanker1.jpg\n|caption = Belarus Class Tanker\n|designation = Interstellar Vessel\n|builder = \n|operator = \n|crew = \n|length = \n|beam = \n|height = \n|powerplant = \n|propulsion = \n|ftl_drive = \n}}\n\n---\r\ntitle: "Belarus_Class_Tanker"\r\npage_id: 2431\r\nnamespace: 0\r\nnamespace_name: "Main"\r\nlatest_revision_id: 6453\r\nlast_updated: "2007-10-04 15:00:46"\r\nauthor: "JDavis"\r\nis_redirect: false\r\ncategories:\r\n  - "Freighters"\r\ntemplates: []\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe Belarus is a class of tanker, a freighter designated for liquid goods hauling. It is built and deployed by the [[Asanova Family Territory]]. No other information is available on this archive at this time.\r\n\r\n[[Image:BelarusClassTanker1.jpg]]\r\n\r\n\r\n[[Image:BelarusClassTanker2.jpg]]\r\n\r\n\r\n[[Image:BelarusClassTanker3.jpg]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Freighters]]'
