        'rawContent': '{{Starship Class Information|\n|name = Torino Class Freighter\n|image = TorinoClassFreighter1.jpg\n|caption = Torino Class Freighter\n|designation = Interstellar Vessel\n|builder = \n|operator = \n|crew = 580\n|length = \n|beam = \n|height = \n|powerplant = \n|propulsion = \n|ftl_drive = \n}}\n\n---\r\ntitle: "Torino_Class_Freighter"\r\npage_id: 3071\r\nnamespace: 0\r\nnamespace_name: "Main"\r\nlatest_revision_id: 7280\r\nlast_updated: "2007-10-11 19:46:40"\r\nauthor: "JDavis"\r\nis_redirect: false\r\ncategories:\r\n  - "Freighters"\r\ntemplates: []\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Dimensions:\r\n**Length: 307.9 meters\r\n**Width: 89.6 meters\r\n**Height: 68.8 meters\r\n**Volume: 853,663.6 m3\r\n*Crew: 580\r\n*Support Crew: 50\r\n*Support Capacity: 128,050 m3 \r\n*Aerospace Complement:\r\n**Various Shuttle Craft\r\n**Universal Docking Collar\r\n*Defensive Systems:\r\n**9 Gradient Gravity Shield Generators\r\n**18 Gravity Stabilizer Couplings\r\n**4 Magnetic Deflector Screens\r\n**Barrier Plasma Shield\r\n**Boron-Nitride Composite Armor\r\n*Sublight Drive: Gravity Cavitation Drive\r\n*Kovalski-Fahr Drive: Brimston Mk IV\r\n\r\n===Overview===\r\n\r\n[[Image:TorinoClassFreighter1.jpg]]\r\n\r\n===Capabilities===\r\n\r\n[[Image:TorinoClassFreighter2.jpg]]\r\n\r\n===Deployment===\r\n\r\n[[Image:TorinoClassFreighter3.jpg]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Freighters]]'
