        'author': 'JDavis',
        'lastUpdated': '2007-11-14 16:40:04',
        'categories': [
            'Starships'
        ],
        'rawContent': "{{Starship Class Information|\n|name = UEAS James Cook\n|image = \n|caption = UEAS James Cook\n|designation = Interstellar Vessel\n|builder = \n|operator = \n|crew = \n|length = \n|beam = \n|height = \n|powerplant = \n|propulsion = \n|ftl_drive = \n}}\n\n---\r\ntitle: \"UEAS_James_Cook\"\r\npage_id: 3322\r\nnamespace: 0\r\nnamespace_name: \"Main\"\r\nlatest_revision_id: 8126\r\nlast_updated: \"2007-11-14 16:40:04\"\r\nauthor: \"JDavis\"\r\nis_redirect: false\r\ncategories:\r\n  - \"Starships\"\r\ntemplates: []\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe UEAS ''James Cook'' was an exploration vessel, commissioned and operated by the [[United Earth Alliance Space Agency]]. It frequently operated under the banner of the [[Alliance of Planets Explorer Corps]].\r\n\r\nThe UEAS ''James Cook'' is credited for initiating [[First Contact]] with the [[Reigens]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:Starships]]"
